                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                        "entry_id": "8ddf5c0c-d11c-3afc-b856-997bc0feead0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a state of excitement, trepidation or agitation; quivering."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23964b73-b54c-4023-9697-a7fc3e1f76cc",
                                "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                                "text": "Sighing softly to the river\nComes the lonely breeze,\nSetting Nature all a-quiver,\nRustling through the trees,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42901416-8e81-457e-90f6-cb9d70b212ed",
                                "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                                "text": "There is no colour line in love, and though a-quiver with ungovernable fright, for Ursula's sake black Woona went graphically through the final death contortions of the poisoned mangy pup."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3dd7d15-3975-4b27-b79f-37ed02d6f723",
                                "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                                "text": "He had gone inland about half a mile when there came suddenly to his trained nostrils the one scent that sets the whole savage jungle aquiver—Tarzan smelled man."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11e9f0f0-d938-4a67-9d31-a6996f2d619d",
                                "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                                "text": "He said \"Stand and deliver / For I am all aquiver.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9da8fec-c957-43f1-847f-3208c3ff17bf",
                                "sense_id": "ffe232d6-f7dc-30d6-b196-a323a00c470b",
                                "text": "Almost the whole continental rim of the Pacific basin is aquiver with earthquakes and fiery with volcanoes, some frequently active, some extinct, some merely sleeping a centuries-long sleep between periods of explosive violence."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
